Nanhe Tare
Aasman mein chamke tare, Lagte hain yeh kitne pyaare. Chote-chote, nanhe-munne, Raat ko lagte sabse nyare.

Chanda mama door ke, Pua pakayein goor ke. Hum bhi unke paas jayenge, Meethe gulgule khayenge.

Sajti hai pariyon ki rani, Sunaati hai ek nayi kahani. So jao ab aankhein band kar ke, Sapno ki duniya hai suhani.
